  "comments": "Different dies are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - bowed portrait with signature on the right truncation of shoulder.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - sitting portrait with signature.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - sitting portrait without signature, bold script of REPUBLICA DE CHILE.<br />\r\nDie 4 - sitting portrait without signature, fine script of REPUBLICA DE CHILE.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Notes</span>. 1. The main difference between bowed and sitting portrait is the rotation of the portrait only with respect to other fragments. After the introducing the die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> at the next dies the portrait was rotated for 4° counterclockwise to make impression of sitting figure.<br />\r\n2. There are many other features, which distinguish the dies, such as size of mintmark and fonts of legends.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61b5fe16c0cd9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61b5fe16c0cd9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"250\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - numeral &#039;5&#039; in denomination with serif at horizontal bar, wide leaves in wreath.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - numeral &#039;5&#039; in denomination without serif at horizontal bar, narrow leaves in wreath.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61b5fe6676fd9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61b5fe6676fd9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"207\" /></a><br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\nNote. From year to year position and font of date differs.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">2002 </span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A1</span> - numerals in date narrow and tall, the date condensed.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A2</span>- numerals in date wide, the date wide.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59ec28299abe3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59ec28299abe3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Edge</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span> - 23.5 grooves/cm.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span> - 27 grooves/cm.<br />\r\nEdge <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span> at the top of the photo, <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span> - at the bottom.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59ec281bbe75b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59ec281bbe75b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">a</span>: 2000, 2001, 2002 A1, 2002 A2, 2003.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2002 A2, 2003, 2008.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2008.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2010-2014.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">b</span>: 2015, 2016.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>: 2017.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">2008</span><br />\r\nIn 2008 coins were struck with both dies <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> and <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> which have additional difference in font of date: bold font die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> (top line of photos) and fine font die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> (bottom line of photos).<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59ec268d8c94b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59ec268d8c94b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"106\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nPhotos of reverses with different styles of dates:<br /><br />\r\nnumerals in date wide and bold, the date wide<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc3b080e27.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc3b080e27.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc3ba9de23.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc3ba9de23.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nnumerals in date wide and fine, the date wide<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc45933b9d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc45933b9d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc460aa5fa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc460aa5fa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"104\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nnumerals in date narrow and tall, the date condensed, position low<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc4e0a1ec0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc4e0a1ec0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nnumerals in date narrow and tall, the date condensed, position high<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc530a3283.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc530a3283.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cdfc53e6fead.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cdfc53e6fead.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" /></a>",
